"P2243665547" "When you get back, the show is just about to end. They're going to announce which wanna-be singers will be bumped up to could-be, and which ones will get cast down into the never-was. Right before the final votes are counted, the program freezes for a moment, and the screen zooms in on one of the contestants. The camera careens from face to face in a blur, each mouth saying part of the same phrase: 'Good Work, {VillainName}'. In an instant, it's over, and the show comes to an end."
// RandomFameString :
"P3462097555" "I keep hearing on the radio about what a menace {VillainName} has become."

