"P1948128126" "By the time you get back, your head is clearer. The Awards show is still on, but it's near the end now. Another pair of interchangeable presenters is up on stage, giving out the last award. With a big flourish, they bring out the last golden envelope, and say: 'And the final award tonight, is for someone who's done a great deal for us all. The award for Loyal defender of Television goes to: <br>{VillainName}, for destroying another wicked agent of Radio!'"
// RandomFameString :
"P2563280795" "I heard on the radio that {VillainName} is on a rampage. No one's safe!"

